  "details": "Version 2020.2.3p1\nThere are some avatars that play audio when they spawn. (Like \"xyz entered the lobby\" or just generic music)\nWhen the user using those avatars is still loading for themselves after entering the world but finished loading for others it'll play the audio regardless for those, even when audio has been disabled by the safety settings, bypassing the safety settings.\nThe audio and custom animation option is turned off for all ranks besides friends and the users using those avatars were not friended.\nThe audio is not coming from their voice/microphone (the \"speaking\" indicator icon is not on and muting them doesn't mute the audio)\nThe audio stops when hiding the avatar and does not play again when showing it again.",
